    rdf:value """Monday, Jan. 9, 1905
Karen’s clothes. Mr. Salting
Miss  Monigan  dressmaker Mrs. Swann dressmaker Call on Sturges 4
Miss Morris
Dine Colefax 85 Onslow Square S.W.
January 1905  Tuesday 10
Went to Ned Warren at Lewes House. Delightful day. 
Emily at 6 to take me to dine with Graham Wallas.
January 1905  Wednesday 11
Lunch Miss Ackerman Michael at Richmond
Eva McLaren called"""^^xsd:string ;
